cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "XLeRobot Household: Edge VLA Deployment and an Evidence-Gated Runtime for a Dual-Arm Household Robot"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-24
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/yechya/xlerobot-household"
abstract: >-
  A dual-arm, three-wheel omnidirectional household service robot built on
  XLeRobot that runs SmolVLA and pi0.5 locally on an NVIDIA Jetson AGX Orin
  with three RGB cameras. The repository provides RoboHarness, an
  evidence-gated runtime in which a vision-language model checks every skill
  before and after execution; LeRobot patches for TensorRT hybrid inference on
  Jetson; and the analysis scripts that recompute the reported measurements. Developed as a National
  College Students' Innovation Training Program project at Nanjing University
  (No. 202610284032), advised by Yuan Du.
